    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you roll Initiative, roll three d20s and record the numbers rolled. You can replace the Initiative roll of a creature with one of these rolls. A creature can’t be affected more than once, and a creature can make a Charisma saving throw to resist this effect. On a success, the die is not applied and is wasted. Each die can only be used once and all dice are lost when you are no longer in Initiative.</p><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.5f044132751934ff]{Три предсказания}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.lyonesse.Item.77da71f295013bbd]{Glimpse the Future}</li></ul>"
